<p># Comments: 45</p>
]]></description><pubDate>Sun, 20 Sep 2026 16:51:26 +0000</pubDate><link>https://radius.to/</link><dc:creator>radius89</dc:creator><comments>https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=49777539</comments><guid isPermaLink="false">https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=49777539</guid></item><item><title><![CDATA[I am often wrong]]></title><description><![CDATA[
